# Mode7Controller, ControlTimerExpired from the TLightSweeps part (listing 4908-4916; FT 0x429bbb): the intro sweep ended:
# ModeStartLights, v_lite14 on, the captured ball is released from a_sink18, mode timer 30.65 s, then MissionControl(ControlMissionStarted)
# shows the countdown text 3035.
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
init watch v_lite14.light_on
10 key down new_game
11 key up new_game
50 poke info_text_box message_field 7
99 expect v_lite14.light_on == 0
100 event light_sweeps ControlTimerExpired
100 expect v_lite14.light_on == 1
100 expect text info_text_box display id 3035
100 expect mode == 7
# the 30.65 s mode timer (about 3065 frames at dt 10 ms; the expiry lands on frame 3164, measured, one frame early by tick order): still mode 7 at 3163,
# mode 3 at 3166 (a 30.0 s timer would already have ended near frame 3100)
3163 expect mode == 7
3166 expect mode == 3
3200 quit
